This file is a placeholder.

Place the 16-row ADNI sample CSV here as `adnimerge_small.csv` before running
the pipeline. The pipeline resolves it via the path
`inputs/adnimerge_small.csv` relative to the `pipeline/` script.

How to obtain the data:
  - Access the ADNI dataset via the LONI Image and Data Archive (IDA):
      https://ida.loni.usc.edu
  - Download ADNIMERGE and extract a 16-row sample (the restricted,
    de-identified participant-level data).
  - Save it in this directory as `adnimerge_small.csv`.

ADNI data are de-identified and distributed under the ADNI Data Use Agreement,
which prohibits redistribution of participant-level data (raw or derived).
For details see the "Data availability" section of README.md.
